\begin{tabular}{lrrrr}
\hline Filter & JONSWAP & PM--Stokes & 3-D & Yaw \\
 & \%$H_s$ & \%$H_s$ & m & deg \\ \hline
OU-II & 20.86 & 11.31 & 1.070 & 0.89 \\
