\hline\end{tabular}\end{center}
Each column reports its worst record; maxima need not come from the same sea. Production and interval-rate limits are qualified separately with a 0.5\% margin and upward rounding. The analytic hull uses encounter corrections, without hull-specific forward-speed hydrodynamics or steering dynamics.
